OL,3,GNEWSAFan collects 1,000 shirts from 55
OL,4,Ayears of football
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan who has been called
OL,7,F"crazy" by his family for his growing
OL,8,Fcollection of 1,000 Norwich City shirts
OL,9,Fsaid his hobby has snowballed over the
OL,10,Fpast 11 years.
OL,12,FBilly Pointer, 36, from Norwich, has
OL,13,Fbecome known as an avid Canaries shirt
OL,14,Fcollector, with his archive showcasing
OL,15,F55 years of history.
OL,17,FThe shirts have taken over a room in
OL,18,Fhis house and led him to meet past
OL,19,Fplayers including Onel Hernandez,
OL,20,FChristoph Zimmermann and Tim Krul.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
