OL,3,GNEWSAFan collects 1,000 shirts from 55
OL,4,Ayears of football
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I like sharing it with other people
OL,7,Fbecause what is my first shirt, for
OL,8,Fexample, could be someone's birthday,
OL,9,Fthe last shirt they went with their
OL,10,Fdad, or their first Norwich City game.
OL,11,FEvery shirt shares 1,000 different
OL,12,Fstories," he said.
